        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Dancer's Curse"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(curse, enchantment, occult, mental)\n\nThe caligni dancer touches a foe and curses it. If the target fails a 18 Will save, it gains clumsy 1 and stupefied 1. The target is then temporarily immune for 24 hours. These conditions persist until the curse is removed. The victim can attempt a new 18 Will save once per hour to end the curse."
            },
